              "text": "स्मयते — smayate — \"smiles\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "शिशुः मातरं पश्यति, स्मयते च। śiśuḥ mātaraṃ paśyati, smayate ca. The baby sees its mother and smiles."
            },
