          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "स्मयते (smayate) comes from the root √smi, \"to smile\", the root of विस्मयः (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
